(
    title: "Alfred Chicken",
    developer: Some("Twilight"),
    description: Some("The Meka-Chickens have eggnapped Billy and his brothers for their cloning experiments, and Alfred sets out through Wild World to get them back. He pecks while standing and dive-bombs while falling, bouncing off springs to reach high ledges. Every balloon on a level must be popped; the last one carries him off to a bonus lab."),
